{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30003_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b6c21103f5bea4129adb1d8b77a596bee8aa71394ee841cf810f5a4435493ccd",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2859da3b057d6f08c37935ba1cc3abcf5c80086f0247b52b4c82c5447fa6978d",
      "text": "真正的心意",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d6ebfbf2d3072e17b333dd955e94acd1c09508b70a19b64a6734e5e9d745364",
      "text": "High×Joker决定接受音乐杂志的采访。\n面对来自平时常读杂志的邀约，成员们兴奋不已。\n然而在这期间，旬的偶像活动却被父亲发现了，\n他陷入了烦恼之中。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_a:cmd-000027:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_a:cmd-000027:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2859da3b057d6f08c37935ba1cc3abcf5c80086f0247b52b4c82c5447fa6978d",
      "text": "真正的心意",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfeae0363372d2d79ed953f727608e6c284eeb03c0674adff29a734498478e78",
      "text": "……综上所述，High×Joker的\n下一项工作是接受音乐杂志的采访！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70d4106287a5e280ad8cfcdfa39f75ac72a0baf9c78f4b2b244c211c6f7b9f4e",
      "text": "好厉害……！\n这本杂志，我平时一直有在看哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dec482341d5d1f5fc4debb7cbad882b55e41fc0d675af7ed81e13dd8514d504f",
      "text": "而且还是以“业界瞩目艺人”为主题的\n采访哦！超级不得了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdf9d2c59b3e4108b16966821b13a72ee4eca3a8e666a7151ff84705d176366b",
      "text": "这样一来我们也能挤进知名乐队的行列中\n了吗？总觉得好紧张啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09cb2a6d8bf6fe3220dcb34f1325aaad9239048e4873685d3f7a7d67353a3d33",
      "text": "我觉得那有点说得太过了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f3ddaa47abf7f05c23620bb474a0c32179c852388b4ce833bf0afd7723293f3",
      "text": "话说回来，和“ARROW・B”的那件事，\n似乎引起了相当大的关注呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:699034385a2196c1f75906d873afa7f3358a47f0e2c85db55d689ee16725d2e4",
      "text": "是的，没错。当天预定会进行写真拍摄\n和访谈采访。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_a:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16b8a820a464e3b79f8be8f54d9c6d1954054871515555240cc40a8eaec9b6e7",
      "text": "这是采访时预定提问的问题清单，\n请在当天之前浏览一遍！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_a:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:019f0bb2eceff3b7a4cc8c4296d4442f56cc9a70876d51628b6fbdc2de4f33bc",
      "text": "采访……\n得想想，要说些什么才行……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_a:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8686bf909d714e4f5d8656c333bdb1760b2abfa3be4dd2462643d085faec47c2",
      "text": "嗯！\n哇——真让人迫不及待啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_b:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d21ea1a76d85623f2857a322f4792ab03df45cef7567a99d5e952a56af4a6583",
      "text": "打扰了。您交代印好的讲义，\n我送过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ba39c7bff6ac663bec6f71bacdddf2f1f082fd4996304e6aee8715ca9d6ffd5",
      "text": "哦，冬美。谢谢你。……说起来，今天的\n课，伊濑谷听得很认真，真是令人欣慰啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6955385b9fc86cc033f8139bec7a53fef8873cb908acd97642ff6cddaced0eb9",
      "text": "是这样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:207cf1ac5c8e18f9865d19724fc6ce4ff15bd517d122987ee7f82d6639e107d9",
      "text": "嗯，非常专注地在看教科书呢。\n那个打瞌睡惯犯伊濑谷居然会那样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a09eae04ae7694c2ab2c78512b30faac72b21fdd0afadf0da61551f0f118122b",
      "text": "也许是加入了轻音部，受了认真的冬美\n的影响吧。哈哈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65f8676b7d9bd262e4f84d5f8fdfc6c8e3d4610be16b0aa00597b4ff449d1547",
      "text": "会是那样吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9322c645c141f9900b7abb6f12622be52403959186d99204613d425f35d2c49c",
      "text": "旬，辛苦了！\n你还没去部活室啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f70e6fc80e3ce9f7ec8b82959fd407f0bc5bc8b70e6110b92da435da87cd625f",
      "text": "是的，因为教职员室有点事。\n……比起那个，隼人，你没事吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7e016214beaffe68dd1826ac39fde57c6a8f2e5aa97a90e9604ea4f5a1bd96c",
      "text": "哎？什么事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a21bb181d51b05710aed9a68f09d72a95b055a702d8765f0a920034e73e2ca3",
      "text": "你的眼眶底下。黑眼圈很严重哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e20243bee31989d870900467be3e4a697502abc77606f085ab5624db107a8b4",
      "text": "啊——……其实，我一想到采访的事，\n就激动得睡不着觉了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e85e1ae1e9258d7f897ed76ad8213efd1217586d5a510994d2936cbb89391e18",
      "text": "一直在琢磨怎么回答会更受欢迎、怎么做显得更帅，\n结果根本停不下来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65451aae5f4a35482de780a96e9b30eb2aace84fbb3b63975b9bc391ffa6c3f7",
      "text": "回过神来天就已经亮了。\n啊哈哈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5db7cc6959a949a4b944de6ae420733b2de5a2c12901d9457c11db947ceccd8",
      "text": "唉……光凭想象，\n亏你能兴奋成那样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f69c451201273e6f10fb46f346a31fe23e48da76a065bc6cb20876e40779d44c",
      "text": "夏来亲，这个姿势怎么样！？\n不对，这样……？脖子的角度再稍微……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0610de015b83dce2408e0e977e23923ed3588347175539abc999681bd35907b",
      "text": "我觉得，挺帅的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a87e9bbc1e55bb2dcd2d0a07f357145cc036d940108517770a96a11be9cd5575",
      "text": "大家辛苦了。\n……等等，四季在干什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29da50fba28aa287989b578dac4635bd79e9bf2df83885f268bdc1a985a95b26",
      "text": "如你所见，在研究上镜效果！\n难得拍写真，不好好耍个帅怎么行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f080bc4cce7ce4cf9e3f7a10beb9493cec08f7ce26488bc57a8509109c0bb839",
      "text": "他说决定不下来到底摆什么姿势好呢。\n自从来了活动室，就一直在那折腾。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48fa64bc92f66a5f30d6ce326fe4503111600d52b6ccafd90db63459662a7501",
      "text": "我……觉得都很帅……就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d27d8e2ae86d3580d167e6556ea3aea1ba3048ad5c111f1d3f3d309db117db5",
      "text": "哎！抢跑太狡猾了四季！\n我也要来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d6eb1e1823aef95b7848b2978c98a8818bacdc71eee8e7c6b3b9c45203d96dd",
      "text": "哦，隼人也要来吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e21ebcc0d7e47b6faa669dd10c7839c555f23249eee42f2a9336ce5d917c015e",
      "text": "唉……怎么总是这么吵吵闹闹的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38610bfe3894564e696709176d2cf1e7fd3ebc9c4fe2a4728b0a7e1b6046958a",
      "text": "四季，这个姿势是不是很帅？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf28ce74f11d572dfb057dbb1f00c7e44b65289a02dd689a13fd8fd020d6e5d4",
      "text": "哦哦，不错嘛！但是，我觉得一定\n还有更帅气的姿势！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a488e8acd9a1d5be46e180b598000c246bd03275c61226ed3c75833ae2b243db",
      "text": "虽然我觉得两个人，都挺帅的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dfd5b56df066d240f51e139145c90d2a1de4af3ce37d803fe4c64bb1245ff3a",
      "text": "不，四季说得对。\n我也要多研究研究，找出最棒的姿势！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5be9128fbc36ed273de55db6dbf58452cb98230bd6258227b9bb807d186bd6ef",
      "text": "既然这样……春名亲、夏来亲！\n希望你们能传授给我们酷炫的姿势！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:308be2e3670bc8a3704f1f5f1288d1f8abcdb9de6fcbcb5366826c1ccbfa974b",
      "text": "哎，我吗……？\n我不太……清楚，呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c30fc8acade6e4fd346ffaefb5d195412e8d0f1e8efef164753e85d7b4c0542",
      "text": "我也是。根本没什么能教你们的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cec58abc56ba5371fb12a460879c0d5fab37c857ea968df12a40e67287313d4",
      "text": "拜托了，无论如何帮帮忙！\n就当是救救我们吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:355e4de585454e887a3c5401f30342f69b11193155fd32ee7df6b8cf0ce6e77a",
      "text": "嗯——……对了。\n试着把一只脚踩在椅子上怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0947a474cb232d9169962bdd6d63e7b5f793b7be499f4d2cab89cd01718cee63",
      "text": "比剪刀手……怎么样呢……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ef76aafbd96921d96073681a9d1d7cc9a5da007593b09a4e9e1f47fc55c2697",
      "text": "……呐，四季。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20fd5d90d89bf2b4763062c448e357dcc927755fe6959cda6fce737e29b27f42",
      "text": "我懂。隼人亲想说什么，\n我痛切地明白……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b3f4210aa85ad67e0595c70e7f2d145884e0b062a952ff7072ce091b27ff6eb",
      "text": "帅哥也太犯规了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000162:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d459263f5c27e1ea2157b40532f188debf2d061dc8ce48ce0765bb372d5cd710",
      "text": "哎？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000177:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa800dd5cc220b1ed03a08bf9326b2b5db621b0c0e5fa15ad51dc5b64969028a",
      "text": "你们两个，就算是土气的姿势摆出来也很帅气，\n根本就参考不了嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000188:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56849e67b358db4f35c5eaa136ab5d771d09e863c4b84abe414c340f812e416a",
      "text": "不是，就算你这么说我也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000196:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a760bf4a8b9f0eca719d2ebc9e8378c6ac349bcde9bc8fd888bfd1838b7a509a",
      "text": "你们闹够了吗？差不多该开始练习了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000208:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000216:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acba654fac19fa49aecd1896b641c14217560d5f5930452e9811f1198124371a",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱，\n辛苦啦～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000218:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4edafb6520435cf8a20ef58937b43ee7707bafe91882680fc92dfd30c33cfc9",
      "text": "看起来没什么精神呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000220:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07f3dcc2f4fb3131f0626f63ed1605aecf5fadaf257d71bb45a69239b82b11b5",
      "text": "就是说啊，听我说嘛～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000222:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a48646f475a043aa6190722bab0b7a8606fb12981e6d5dba4e17a12c033bb734",
      "text": "旬亲跟我说：“历史老师夸四季君的\n上课态度很认真哦”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000224:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62f05c0157276dce74ad656c839ae3a1bde8f548322abd2052e9a58ded7294d2",
      "text": "可是我完全没有头绪……\n说到底，我压根没有上课的记忆来着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000226:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:697e7367ded83a15a6b479ad8f28cc1c61d24518aed0f0f0bce64e4bd02b9bb9",
      "text": "历史课的时候，我只是在把教科书里大叔们的\n帅气姿势记在笔记上而已……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000228:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24318030a9bff0848c71fcb1b6f5dd140d635f9c4ede22fe176dd96f5f95af6b",
      "text": "课上的内容虽然完全不知道，\n但姿势倒是学了好多！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000230:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:588ab53233870b244d76a58a7cd73d8cc2bae12306aa229caf3a5e9f9285a1c9",
      "text": "……结果跟旬亲一说，被超级大骂了一顿。\n真的，我觉得根本没必要那么生气嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000232:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:341a60d309c930204639d1e600194c4ce73b123e1b51be0bbf03f81b206265aa",
      "text": "学习也\n要好好努力才行",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_d:cmd-000234:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6ce94d47372d082130f06ed97fe02132e3d18c671e3c958a7e1fbe2904ac8b2",
      "text": "哇——！不想听，不想听——！\n那就这样，制作人酱，拜拜啾！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_e:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_e:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2505d06be60b4de53a04f502152b40ad70bc3608f507d854b71ef949379466e1",
      "text": "冬美家",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "text": "我回来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6bc846c6281d828067a01158dc4a612ff4cde9412a1877cdcf347541affefb8",
      "text": "……是旬啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96354ce67a316844c0cbe8459bf8aff666bf8d39b529945e0d52444fdf516596",
      "text": "您、您回来了。父亲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71c8370086344a51c1815e0bb789c644eb36941d3fad653354d28a79b157714c",
      "text": "（吓了一跳。\n平时明明都回来得更晚的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:694791b2959979b4a726074d3d2efd29e59f2128467209bbf2af63c0c9e22be1",
      "text": "嗯。比起那个，旬，\n你回得相当晚啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21db38ddd139adb13caf79ba2f10f9cf2fc949ed0b498b75a31c140391d7933f",
      "text": "今天有社团活动。\n之后还商量了偶像工作上的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1b8b8ab0e81110708a3b54a6491d77519840df1692cdcd088e5ca874af97a20",
      "text": "……我听说了。你最近好像在偶像那种东西上\n浪费了不少无谓的时间吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fec0faf47b859b0cf9ca7571ae3ac0d4dbda5f4c535d553d75b1bb7753a64227",
      "text": "每次都要练习到这么晚吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf1d8aaeafe0fabd4146c2946a941e7bc0f5f84673ef4848c50991bfe7787079",
      "text": "学生的本职是学习。别再沉迷于偶像那种\n小孩子的玩闹之中了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_e:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ace45ac32484111927db083087205de73d0ce0bc8f4b5568edc1f5907f625314",
      "text": "（……小孩子的玩闹，吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_f:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b83114a141c6d3571af5488ad2b6916387047dbf4bd0ba71178fdca5b0e2a226",
      "text": "（但是，会被这么想也是理所当然的吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_f:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e0a1e6d05f0a472a85803288e6420217021cbb29770a9779222a05ecd9cd6f0",
      "text": "（轻音部也好，最初也是因为觉得拒绝隼人的邀请\n很麻烦，才随波逐流加入的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_f:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bad15a4fa84c48ef4800245aa57a1dc77306e8bc0248564c2b392f11188cf5c",
      "text": "（偶像活动也一样，并不是带着明确的目标\n才开始的。但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c72076dca3ea56388f05ce76b34384efab15c3445c92dbc58323cec9c64b452a",
      "text": "（现在我觉得偶像活动很快乐……\n是真的想要认真做下去）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_f:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d500313c703054f52511928b68f6b021479566492192c1a599f512da5cea83b",
      "text": "（所以，我……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_f:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:350e5e6e99471c3f1c1c38d0efc669196b03b148b99e13d3b41f72e12557af22",
      "text": "旬。你在听吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_f:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb9aadafdbd391b242df6a6a0c409fe15850e8bd3dfaa2763c3b167a8c026c2f",
      "text": "……学习和偶像活动，我都会兼顾好的。\n就算父亲不说，我也明白。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_f:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b2d24ae0cfc27e918c0c2a6e074046bdb233dc22b36818b317fe4566820261c",
      "text": "明明一直不管不问，现在才来指手画脚。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_f:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db910d0c651e288f45ad44748b26ee0da4efc1a7b01b1e6a65e95bb3fc44ab56",
      "text": "旬。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb174607f6454a768b3448e226a0d2a8eb88b846c7d2be7eb54792a3f577230a",
      "text": "总之，不需要您为我担心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_g:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_g:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ec984867044230c956140e5b57da0217f73b3c3e4561fdd5094c955fb3fb75c",
      "text": "嗯——好累啊！一直在开会，\n差不多该休息一下了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_g:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c697a9d207e0142fcf328ddb2fdf35a11d021630d039e37260e79952ae29b506",
      "text": "不行。还有很多必须要讨论的事情\n没处理完呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_g:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a1ab88ccf52cf1e1f9717ea40f2797733674a99b0cbdd6be7f5898aac221c7d",
      "text": "哎——！可是，稍微休息一下嘛！\n制作人酱也这么觉得对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_g:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0766f69b3fead27937ad20da4e2125cb31b7841406d107543642ff3a0f03914",
      "text": "我也赞同四季的想法。\n崩得太紧也不好啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_g:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a45cb8b9d92f8850732e553b9b384bc355cbc86439f5057caf02fa57196e3d7c",
      "text": "可是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_g:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56e35405298cd923d1f788882dfb3dc068df4ed08004006b65dcc058716c74a3",
      "text": "旬……感觉，怪怪的……\n不仅是今天，最近一直都……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_g:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5565922f03fc5ee32ebe953b7aa6a7260e95097059f00cccb32a67552aa2dd38",
      "text": "我也这么觉得。\n发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_g:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac36e64fa46d3e51c6f449eb066a341b846b738b5ca7632737ffc0c23bdeda7b",
      "text": "……没有那回事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_g:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9dc7b5dbff8e91d95ff51de6d9f5599265c211b45d2875a7d244c75176979ef",
      "text": "不，我也觉得你和往常的样子不太一样。\n如果有什么事，可以跟我商量一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_g:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6127a19728f3cf9c2643904a447d160758bd7dd7f8b22900c9686bed6c2e78e6",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー……\n……我知道了。其实……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ef90c7d78d844414fff9d8c0fbc3c631fb2fc015355e286457a007e97e586f5",
      "text": "这样啊，被父亲反对了吗——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ac149d9acf06932b74204e7bd1953fd9b7426f3ab6924574eecc284719eacc3",
      "text": "反正，本来也没觉得\n他会赞成就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:431c460f8b9ef327335b53cc29fe6b85c057f43992874e39e4f6c2f315dfda05",
      "text": "……但是，我无法接受。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a27e307f43f1cc5e25cfb1136d94da757097997176a28fbb4b505a146af0b6f2",
      "text": "原来如此。最近的旬之所以干劲满满，\n原来是这么一回事啊～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b706654a3f73e5a66e121505a9c012e595e7ddedc4fa8fa5e7ab290779b8324",
      "text": "真是的！太见外了，旬亲！\n为什么不依赖一下我们呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64bccf7585af5c99c615119ad63b2f6dc942c468d08a91850c310fc90cb6ca1b",
      "text": "毕竟这是我自己的问题……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:818935a90773c7f7633b4b4192b191663acd947139f3ad265bb418432d58c5b9",
      "text": "别一个人扛着啊，旬。\n我们5个人在一起才是High×Joker啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:893427cf49acb332c92677f853bfcaebf0b1c2c035d70cf2fa3f78eb3fe68a3f",
      "text": "隼人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fca63ee0da5763bdf081b69f1bd648ce03a43d0afd5f300f4eb96f659bbb78ec",
      "text": "旬……去跟你父亲，谈谈吧……？\n我也会，一起去的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47fbb377e971476329f70541724e9d856bfac11cefffbfa4496a16c1711a91fa",
      "text": "我们也去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14266cba9017d0f9e165eb4436f2655b966327609b5fcefc0c4e6c3f04604956",
      "text": "请让我也一同前往吧。\n我希望能郑重地与他谈一谈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df7b9d0acfde7aca3c6cfbc9adc79d90c2e4207ba1b032223cf4c7eefba35cf6",
      "text": "……我知道了。虽然不知道他愿不愿意听，\n但我会试着求求父亲的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000123:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000130:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7783e9f1a59fa5e03fa498d9387cbed42f784eae1f0d202e6fa2a9cfa604971",
      "text": "父亲回复说，\n愿意听我们谈一谈了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000132:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62fe5015203f9bd50fc3dbb04bfb692c2e585832e2f932f4a681bfc453f0892d",
      "text": "真的吗？太好了——！\n第一道关卡总算是突破了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000134:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cef7628c04ee313d2dc4e94bcd66a781bf3d06f5e44c6d8cda9575b4260a06b9",
      "text": "接下来，只要好好把我们的心意\n传达给他，就行了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000136:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e7ca4a835b12b213a32f5f701b0d9b41a24c0bc7dad3a04348f876c5edde413",
      "text": "要全力向他表明，\n我们非常需要旬亲<emoji>image_talk_emoji_37</emoji><emoji>image_talk_emoji_42</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000138:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:316bd76e205f2c0502750c8044cef60152ab1cc29e2af7ad67438493b5d2a7f4",
      "text": "好——嘞，来开作战会议吧！\n大家一起想想，\n都要传达些什么！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000140:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09be8aa9616a4e8d20326c181238ca315570b4afdc39c334e169572adfcefa12",
      "text": "旬的键盘，\n弹得非常棒。我觉得换作其他人，\n肯定都模仿不来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000142:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0561d70eae236f4fc8f3504fefe559b67f53b205aa9ca2891d49eac9e09adb44",
      "text": "确实，要是没有了旬的键盘，\n那就不算我们的音乐了啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000144:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:346207fd9cdae234dc1b97d62f0f587b1ad93a958730d99565dfddcbc94bc30c",
      "text": "还有别的吗…辅导学习这方面？\n说真的，真是帮了大忙了呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000146:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d26fc9cdd31a797f04c8e6e3036a3bb7820d66194ab9f10daa96e3985df91b4a",
      "text": "这个我懂！\n…虽然，也有点严厉就是了…",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000148:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a799ac002daa536e0d973f1b16083150931c1a17b4dae19a2d420f1361ae1e1f",
      "text": "还有…\n能提出冷静客观的意见之类的…？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000150:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3d98ece0493c98138130d23dc3e72b27b4a02fcd50e18d71aa95ac95293c447",
      "text": "把心意传达给他吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000150:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c789c08780d06686048cd94af1595e682673143d2015c7ed1ca40f403d2e8ba",
      "text": "没问题的。\n将旬先生原原本本的真实心意\n传达给他吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000153:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3e06682b8076849d92fdc40a822ab17b44fc25b7f7ad573b30ba4c415a2b28",
      "text": "原原本本的真实心意吗？\n但是，父亲愿意听我说吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_h:cmd-000155:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afc82edff11c0f79a2c4f9353d223391d336e0005ef7d52a70cd8b1298959860",
      "text": "说的也是呢。\n我会试着表达的。\n明天就拜托各位了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000030:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07d9d20a6e345d1232f3e3b7c104e1112ecee527b513b61376fca0e575d7868d",
      "text": "冬美家·客厅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64225cbc7cd61f948f9fdcf3a313f2447205375d8b783d3a99459c5793c36339",
      "text": "你们就是和旬一起\n做偶像活动的孩子们吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2ef591619bab164c926a8cd59bce9d7c3b6840367a661d0c5d72cfdf5fe104b",
      "text": "是的。我们作为名为High×Joker的\n团体在进行活动。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1a64a3452e4a7ee1ef407a6fc4559bd9e1daf26ed36decf7b9e78abe1b19a9e",
      "text": "果然夏来君也在一起啊。\n我心里多少猜到了些。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:392d8c3d0a8fa3d86b87d0777553f82f3af2fa5390b4684de3c622c67f5decf9",
      "text": "罢了，那些暂且不论。\n话说回来，你们全都是高中生吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54b709829f0d3ea5c47f939deff632d8ad8e836a9c414eee453ce0c5b8d0e424",
      "text": "考虑到升学考试，你们也别把时间浪费在\n这种玩闹上了，专心于学业如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed07c0134d9a906baa78c6e3c3effc6603f701b4183d0748836dd96169e1e7aa",
      "text": "请等一下！\n我们绝不是抱着玩玩的心态在做的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd2a56288dd9d4a72e44c46e4840683801c9e65e1f71bdb2ffb72175b9636b0c",
      "text": "我们是真……认真地打算以偶像的身份\n出人头地！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac5c9e612d709799b133e1e7e3009ef8048b363376a9acac57a589de71b43071",
      "text": "我们所有人都是认真的。\n请理解我们的这份心意！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:047cd6fb4c000b38d8e0b424ec89b9d00a509851de47a571cbebd60e47c1fa28",
      "text": "……旬和我们，对待偶像都是真心的……\n请您，相信我们……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a5b15d2b681d57f2871a910fff38463a7e277e95fb823a0873b290a405c089d",
      "text": "……父亲，我是认真的。\n我想试着看看，我们5个人到底能走到多远。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5126e61bbbb460fbf5193256aad13bf9ff11ff0495b64fcb9d580ba6ae2f3148",
      "text": "我……想和大家一起把偶像做下去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_j:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b1b202124eb27819e96ad0b73cb9ffff6df2d131aa31519e99775c3642bb478",
      "text": "……你就是●●●●プロデューサー吧。\n听说你在担任这5个人的制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:582ba153484efc1a7727131f248f692a84bf311820cd9327f01ad6b34bb16bc3",
      "text": "难道你也被这帮小孩子说的话\n给牵着鼻子走了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_j:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d79839212d973c768ee2e788bd4f84dc1486fd2c54a39f97fe21d40bfefc9bff",
      "text": "是的。我也被他们感染了。\n因为这就是他们的力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_j:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aea72c033ef10e59b814bf6c920360a0129cc015a36c28d1deb473eec72df5e7",
      "text": "他们是能带给人们梦想的巨星。正因如此，\n我想支持他们，和他们一起追逐梦想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_j:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_j:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1fc7c586366b011a9e6e1159d56935851b79baef684a611bdce5c6d9391e11a",
      "text": "……这样啊。\n既然如此，我就不再多言了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_j:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9b7032e0345daf310c53d5d196d1d3281fdd4bde8526e7828a14af3de82985d",
      "text": "旬，剩下的随你便吧。\n……上杂志也好，做什么都随你去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0955f5f2b80614b2cb116d210a35977ac06d27e5c555fcf586d05c433a1acbf3",
      "text": "……！谢谢您，父亲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ec80f4ac960e1ab327270c650e854407c1392f85f404b0282fc2fb9355b40ac",
      "text": "旬……太好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_j:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0595927c03d2301756543e9ee29a792727b6fc21fc8dfaabd7afce359776d0d",
      "text": "太好啦——！\n这样5个人就能继续做偶像了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_j:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9356224512934d5902b16127b964a5222e63e4c4a7f44976f85fbe625ec97f38",
      "text": "嗯。果然，不能没有旬啊。\n我们5个在一起才是High×Joker嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_j:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d42d9f9fec564a63434a763c08a96c15e72473da19dbd19cc8b98c696c3438ea",
      "text": "太棒了！\n大家，接下来的杂志工作也要加油啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_k:cmd-000029:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:205b537162a622d6c13223069f400d4e8d55bf55b3cd45c60b78e4ab8e51e99c",
      "text": "拍摄当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_k:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09d20e8ece661ea5a579590a1a407e9821a609572bd2f71cf7570ab25150fc85",
      "text": "大家的笑容都很棒哦——！\n那我就接二连三地拍咯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_k:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14c53cabcabb2a5e6bc9dcf98b28fe370da808565048012335feda13ff075bd8",
      "text": "好——！拜托您了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_k:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96055f05f70fe2ba2d991539bd11e2d5be6cac42802fb6c28b7be71f56ca7cc9",
      "text": "春名……看起来好开心……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_k:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1afc8cac2c902a9e920b0848a46e9ad8335a6b08d39d07baf4d705c4b809809f",
      "text": "啊，看出来了？总觉得5个人一起\n做偶像，真的超级开心啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_k:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:209b6e950866617fb0e849f0729553b8feb5c0b83f4f93506e5c31a0e23f3080",
      "text": "我懂这种感觉——！我现在也是\n超级无敌开心快乐的心情！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_k:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34644eee6fee02462c8c93f78c647f6c5df5841c1c0d2c243284eed0dcd41903",
      "text": "喂大家，难得有乐器在，要不要试着演奏\n看看？我都想立刻和大家一起玩音乐了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_k:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1edd1b93d1638799e607383c9c6462d997bdfa92e212f4332ca27fcf57f4664",
      "text": "拍照中途别自作主张啊……\n……嘛，我倒是没意见就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_k:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39d56a3061d369933f751846dc93fecfb9095cd250375ef3dc2adedf8a7ed11f",
      "text": "嗯……旬要演奏的话，我也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_k:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcab10de5ebaf60354904b8458a67162d4fd1c0c7d4b3b5c78f15ba1f83065c5",
      "text": "不错嘛！说不定能拍到大家绝佳的表情，\n尽管按你们喜欢的样子弹吧——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_k:cmd-000187:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2db3e9b043563357998d42030d2ededddc5e2c817d8e72dd0fb4adb23b7fe9c1",
      "text": "那么各位，请听这首歌！\nHigh×Joker的《OUR SONG》！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_k:cmd-000303:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5379e80557682fd4984f8f6077611a6151c39b47855b3a5a5de09841444b2af",
      "text": "大家，跟我们一起，享受青春吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_k:cmd-000309:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377",
      "text": "哦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
